{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在获得了作为活动基础的\\n我们2-T班同学的同意之后——", "text_idx": 166, "plain": "在获得了作为活动基础的我们2-T班同学的同意之后——", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么以后还要多多拜托大家了」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3184", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自此，以我和爱理为中心，\\n在全校范围内开展的署名活动终于正式开始了。", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "自此，以我和爱理为中心，在全校范围内开展的署名活动终于正式开始了。", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「结业式之前真的没多少天了，\\n　感觉事情可能会变得相当了不得……」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": "「结业式之前真的没多少天了，　感觉事情可能会变得相当了不得……」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……那我先从高三学生那里探探情况吧。\\n　我去找找那些可能会来帮助我们的人」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "「唔……那我先从高三学生那里探探情况吧。　我去找找那些可能会来帮助我们的人」", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0303", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜！」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0094", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，熊喵也跟着一块来」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0304", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我负责高一」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0641", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样的话我就负责去高二其他班看看吧，\\n　嘛，毕竟我还蛮有人气的，所以应该没什么问题吧」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「那样的话我就负责去高二其他班看看吧，　嘛，毕竟我还蛮有人气的，所以应该没什么问题吧」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样的话，我就去学生会那边\\n　问问有没有人愿意协助我们吧～」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「那样的话，我就去学生会那边　问问有没有人愿意协助我们吧～」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0252", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都把话语带到了各自不同的方向，\\n努力完善着这次的合作体制。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "大家都把话语带到了各自不同的方向，努力完善着这次的合作体制。", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我去老师那边打点打点……\\n　啊啊，之后还要让大家在校长面前务必保密」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "「那我去老师那边打点打点……　啊啊，之后还要让大家在校长面前务必保密」", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0182", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然，\\n　不对那个人守口如瓶的话就不行吗」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "「……果然，　不对那个人守口如瓶的话就不行吗」", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，毕竟咱们做的这些事像是在打游击一样……\\n　联名书交到她手里之前若不瞒天过海的话，她多半会处处和我们针锋相对的」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「啊哈哈，毕竟咱们做的这些事像是在打游击一样……　联名书交到她手里之前若不瞒天过海的话，她多半会处处和我们针锋相对的」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 61, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0183", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「突然交到母亲手里的话，她肯定会吓一跳的。\\n　虽然很不好意思，但是教师那边就拜托您了，八冢老师」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「突然交到母亲手里的话，她肯定会吓一跳的。　虽然很不好意思，但是教师那边就拜托您了，八冢老师」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3185", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，我知道啦。一起加油吧濑名同学」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0184", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然后签名纸以及其他用具的筹备的话，\\n　就交给我安洁来处理吧～～♪」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "「然后签名纸以及其他用具的筹备的话，　就交给我安洁来处理吧～～♪」", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
