{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实如同新吾同学所说的那样呢」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……当时脱口而出了」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "都没有理会当时的氛围。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然而……该怎么说呢，这股子兴奋劲儿。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
